Modification notice (Apache-2.0, section 4(b))

This distribution contains a modified version of OpenAI Codex. The files listed in
`patches/model-provider-routes.patch` were changed to add:

  * the `model_provider_routes` configuration key (model slug -> provider id),
  * per-session model provider routing for `thread/start` and `thread/resume`,
  * rejection of cross-provider model selections on `thread/start`, `thread/resume`,
    `thread/settings/update`, and subagent spawns,
  * configuration validation for routes that name an unknown provider.

This modification is unofficial: it is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by OpenAI.
